OL,3,GNorth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FEarly bright spells will give
OL,6,Fway to increasing cloud from the west
OL,7,Fon Thursday morning, and this will
OL,8,Flead into a wet and quite blustery
OL,9,Fafternoon. The strongest winds will be
OL,10,Faround coasts and high ground. Some
OL,11,Fheavy rain developing.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FThe heaviest of the rain will
OL,14,Fclear eastwards this evening, leaving
OL,15,Fshowers for a time, these easing by
OL,16,Fdawn with some clearer spells. A
OL,17,Fmilder night than the previous night.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
